# Build protocol

Spec to types to gates to code. Verify with F5 Extension Host in Cursor.

| Phase | Gate |
|---|---|
| **0 Bootstrap** | F5 works; empty panel; registerServer on activate; no CSP errors |
| **1 Disk to pixels** | HTML file save refreshes iframe (~200ms); generation bumps |
| **2 MCP loop** | set/update/read/list/set_active; baseGeneration conflicts; MCP-offline banner |
| **3 Export** | export + handoff_status stale mark; IMPLEMENT.md usable |
| **4 Release polish** | MIT, screenshots, honest limits |

DoD demo: hero+CTA then export then implement into Vite + plain HTML sample. Handoff = HTML+CSS+JS.

Do not invent features outside the Notion spec without asking Bombic.
